		{
			dependencies: ["08944BA280502565"]
			description: [
				"This massive multiblock will allow you to locally change the laws of the universe within a small space in order to synthesize materials with specific properties completely from scratch."
				""
				"All recipes in this multiblock take at least UHV power, so you might want to invest in some new energy hatches."
				""
				"While the UHV capacitor is not required in the controller's recipe, it is a part of the multiblock."
				""
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"In preparation for making this thing, you should probably invest in some endgame multiblocks, such as the rotary hearth furnace and others. You might need many fusion reactors, as well as tons of rare materials."
